793
00:35:11.900 --> 00:35:12.620
Oh, yeah.

794
00:35:13.520 --> 00:35:17.940
My husband, married to the writer, no big whoop.

795
00:35:17.940 --> 00:35:18.960
That's so cool.

796
00:35:19.320 --> 00:35:24.520
And it starts previews on September 6th, and it opens on September 15th, and you can get

797
00:35:24.520 --> 00:35:26.120
tickets at goodmantheater.org.

798
00:35:26.320 --> 00:35:27.360
I'm really excited.

799
00:35:27.580 --> 00:35:31.020
This will be my first time back on stage in about eight years.

800
00:35:31.340 --> 00:35:34.000
And you know, theater is my first love, so I'm really excited.

801
00:35:34.160 --> 00:35:35.680
That is so cool, Jenna.

802
00:35:35.840 --> 00:35:37.980
I'm so excited for you and Lee.

803
00:35:38.120 --> 00:35:39.180
That is just awesome.

804
00:35:39.540 --> 00:35:40.100
Thank you.

805
00:35:40.100 --> 00:35:45.440
And this is the Goodman Theater's 100th year, so this is their centennial season, and we'll

806
00:35:45.440 --> 00:35:47.140
be kicking it off with Ashland Avenue.

807
00:35:47.240 --> 00:35:47.820
No big deal.

808
00:35:48.080 --> 00:35:49.160
No big deal, though.

809
00:35:49.580 --> 00:35:53.160
And Angela's got some fun news as well.

810
00:35:53.340 --> 00:35:54.040
I do.

811
00:35:54.340 --> 00:36:01.880
So, you know, Ed, my husband's a chef and a baker, and he's self-taught, and he's really

812
00:36:01.880 --> 00:36:06.040
