813
00:36:06.040 --> 00:36:08.400
that the kitchen is the heart of our home.

814
00:36:08.540 --> 00:36:13.200
And he's been making recipes, and we've been cooking together for years now, and he's

815
00:36:13.200 --> 00:36:17.140
