816
00:36:17.260 --> 00:36:22.780
It's called You Can Make This, because that's what he says to me and the kids all the time.

817
00:36:22.800 --> 00:36:25.760
He's like, you guys can make this, and you really can.

818
00:36:25.760 --> 00:36:30.460
And so we have that coming out in October of this year, and it's really great.

819
00:36:30.640 --> 00:36:32.180
It's a great, great cookbook.

820
00:36:32.520 --> 00:36:33.000
Congratulations.

821
00:36:34.000 --> 00:36:35.380
That's so, so cool.

822
00:36:35.700 --> 00:36:36.420
Thank you.

823
00:36:36.420 --> 00:36:42.720
I'm excited to tell you about my book coming out in another year called Super Duper Nuker.

824
00:36:43.400 --> 00:36:43.920
Not true.

